msgstr "Zaɓi Bayanin Tushen Bayanai.  Bayanin Tushen Bayanai yana sarrafa tazarar tattarawa, haɗa bayanai, da manufar riƙewa don Tushen Bayanan da suka fito."

#: include/global_form.php
