#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓuka na Yau da Kullum"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Take (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Kadupul documentation."
msgstr "Sunan da aka buga a kan jadawalin.  Yana iya haɗawa da masu canji na maye gurbi kamar |host_description| ko |query_fieldName|.  Don cikakken jerin alamun maye gurbi da ake tallafawa, duba takardun Kadupul."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Alamar Tsaye (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Alamar da aka buga a tsaye zuwa hagun jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Tsarin Hoto (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Nau'in jadawalin da aka samar; PNG, GIF ko SVG.  Zaɓin nau'in hoton jadawali ya dogara sosai da RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Tsayi (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Tsayin (cikin pixels) na yankin jadawali a cikin jadawalin. Wannan yankin bai haɗa da maɓallin bayani, bayanan axis, ko take ba."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Faɗi (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Faɗin (cikin pixels) na yankin jadawali a cikin jadawalin. Wannan yankin bai haɗa da maɓallin bayani, bayanan axis, ko take ba."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Ƙimar Asali (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Ya kamata a saita zuwa 1024 don ƙwaƙwalwa (memory) da 1000 don auna zirga-zirga."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Yanayin Gangara (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Amfani da Yanayin Gangara yana daidaita siffar jadawalai a madadin wani ɗan haske a allo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Sikeli"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Ma'auni Ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Idan an kunna, Zaɓin Sikeli Ta Atomatik da aka zaɓa yana ƙayyade iyakokin da RRDtool ke amfani da su: --alt-autoscale yana watsar da iyakoki biyu, --alt-autoscale-max yana riƙe iyakar ƙasa, --alt-autoscale-min yana riƙe iyakar sama, kuma --alt-autoscale (karɓar iyakoki biyu) yana riƙe iyakoki biyu. Idan an kashe, ana amfani da iyakokin ƙasa da sama da aka saita kai tsaye. Tsauraran Iyakoki yana sarrafa ko ƙimomin da ke wajen waɗannan iyakokin suna faɗaɗa kewayon jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Ma'auni Ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Yi amfani da <br> --alt-autoscale don sikeli zuwa mafi ƙanƙanta da mafi girma na gaske <br> --alt-autoscale-max don sikeli zuwa ƙima mafi girma, ta amfani da iyakar ƙasa da aka bayar <br> --alt-autoscale-min don sikeli zuwa ƙima mafi ƙanƙanta, ta amfani da iyakar sama da aka bayar <br> --alt-autoscale (tare da iyakoki) don sikeli ta amfani da iyakokin ƙasa da sama duka (na asali na RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale (rashin kula da iyakokin da aka bayar)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale-max (karɓar iyakar ƙasa)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale-min (karɓar iyakar sama)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale (karɓar iyakoki biyu, na asali na RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Ma'aunin Logarithmic (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Yi amfani da sikelin y-axis na Logarithmic"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Rukunin SI don Ma'aunin Logarithmic (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Yi amfani da Naúrorin SI don Sikelin Logarithmic maimakon amfani da bayanin exponential.<br> Lura: Jadawalai na layi suna amfani da bayanin SI ta tsoho."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Yanayin Tsayayyun Iyakoki (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Kada a faɗaɗa iyakar ƙasa da sama idan jadawalin ya ƙunshi ƙima a wajen kewayon da ke da inganci."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Iyakar Sama (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Mafi girman ƙimar tsaye don jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Ƙaramar Iyaka (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Mafi ƙanƙantar ƙimar tsaye don jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Grid"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Ƙimar Grid na Naúra (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Yana saita ƙimar madaidaiciya a kan Y-axis don lambobi. Lura: An daina amfani da wannan zaɓin kuma an maye gurbinsa da zaɓin --y-grid.  A cikin wannan zaɓi, layukan grid na Y-axis suna bayyana a kowane tazarar matakin grid.  Ana sanya alamomi a kowane layukan abin alama."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Ƙimar Madaidaicin Naúrar (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Kadupul should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Wace naúra Kadupul zai yi amfani da ita a kan Y-axis. Yi amfani da 3 don nuna komai a cikin \"k\" ko -6 don nuna komai a cikin \"u\" (micro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Tsayin Naúra (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Lambobi nawa ya kamata RRDtool ya ɗauka alamun y-axis suna da su? Wataƙila za ku yi amfani da wannan zaɓin don samar da isasshen sarari da zarar kun fara daidaita alamun y-axis."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Babu Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Domin guje wa dusashewar anti-aliasing RRDtool yana daidaita maki zuwa pixels na ƙudurin na'ura, wannan yana haifar da bayyanar da ta fi kaifi. Idan ba ka son wannan, za ka iya amfani da wannan maɓalli don kashe wannan ɗabi'ar.<br><strong>Lura: </strong>An kashe Gridfitting ga fitarwar PDF, EPS, SVG ta asali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Madadin Grid na Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Algorithm ɗin yana tabbatar da cewa koyaushe kana da grid, cewa akwai isassun layukan grid amma ba masu yawa ba, kuma grid ɗin na metric ne. Wannan ma'aunin kuma zai tabbatar da samun isassun lambobin decimal da aka nuna ko da jadawalinka ya tashi daga 69.998 zuwa 70.001.<br><strong>Lura: </strong>Wannan ma'aunin na iya tsoma baki tare da zaɓuɓɓukan --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Axis"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Axis na Dama (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Za a zana axis na biyu zuwa dama na jadawalin. Yana da alaƙa da axis na hagu ta hanyar sigogin sikelin da motsi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Alamar Axis na Dama (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Alamar axis na dama."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Tsarin Axis na Dama (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ta hanyar asali, ana tantance tsarin lakabin axis ta atomatik. Idan kana son yin wannan da kanka, yi amfani da wannan zaɓin tare da sigogin %lf iri ɗaya da ka sani daga umarnin PRINT da GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Mai Tsara Axis na Dama (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Lokacin da ka saita alamar axis na dama, yi amfani da ƙa'ida ga tsarin bayanai.  Tsare-tsaren da ake tallafawa sun haɗa da \"numeric\" inda ake ɗaukar bayanai a matsayin lambobi, \"timestamp\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin alamun lokacin UNIX (adadin sakan tun Janairu 1970) kuma ana bayyana su ta amfani da tsarin strftime (na asali shi ne \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Duba kuma --units-length da --right-axis-format.  A ƙarshe \"duration\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin tsawon lokaci cikin milliseconds.  Tsarawa yana bin ƙa'idodin valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Mai Tsara Axis na Hagu (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Lokacin da ka saita alamar axis na hagu, yi amfani da ƙa'ida ga tsarin bayanai.  Tsare-tsaren da ake tallafawa sun haɗa da \"numeric\" inda ake ɗaukar bayanai a matsayin lambobi, \"timestamp\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin alamun lokacin UNIX (adadin sakan tun Janairu 1970) kuma ana bayyana su ta amfani da tsarin strftime (na asali shi ne \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Duba kuma --units-length.  A ƙarshe \"duration\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin tsawon lokaci cikin milliseconds.  Tsarawa yana bin ƙa'idodin valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Bayani"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Cika Sarari Ta Atomatik"

