#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Izinon Jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph access is granted directly by a graph permission in every mode. Permissive also grants access when the user has permission for the graph's device or template. Restrictive requires permission for both the device and template when there is no direct graph permission. Device Based requires device permission, and Graph Template Based requires template permission. User and group policies are evaluated separately and their allowed results are combined. These modes trade query performance against fine-grained permissions on large installations."
msgstr "Ana ba da izinin shiga jadawali kai tsaye ta izinin jadawali a kowane yanayi. Yanayin Sauƙi (Permissive) yana kuma ba da izini idan mai amfani yana da izinin na'urar jadawalin ko samfurinsa. Yanayin Tsauri (Restrictive) yana buƙatar izini na duka na'urar da samfurin idan babu izinin jadawali kai tsaye. Yanayin Bisa Na'ura yana buƙatar izinin na'ura, kuma Yanayin Bisa Samfurin Jadawali yana buƙatar izinin samfuri. Ana tantance manufofin mai amfani da na rukuni daban-daban sannan a haɗa sakamakonsu da aka amince da su. Waɗannan yanayoyi suna daidaita saurin tambaya da cikakken iko kan izini a manyan tsare-tsare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Mai Sauƙi (Permissive)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Mai Tsauri (Restrictive)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Bisa Na'ura"

