msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Ƙirƙirar Jadawali/Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Idan an saita zuwa Simple, za a iya ƙirƙirar Jadawalai da Tusoshin Bayanai daga Sabbin Jadawalai kawai. Idan Advanced, ana tallafawa tsohuwar hanyar ƙirƙirar Jadawali da Tushen Bayanai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Mai Sauƙi"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Na Gaba"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Nuna Taimakon Fom/Saiti a Cikin Layi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓa, za a nuna Taimakon Fom da Saiti a cikin layi.  In ba haka ba za a gabatar da shi yayin da aka tsaya a kan maɓallin taimako."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Taimakon Shafin Gida Kawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Kadupul page help is located at kadupul.org.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Kadupul server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ta hanyar asali taimakon shafin Kadupul yana a kadupul.org. Duk da haka, idan tsarinka ba shi da damar Intanet, za ka iya sauke takardun a gida a cikin tsarin HTML kuma ka karɓi baƙuncinsa a wurin 'docs' na sabar Kadupul ɗinka. Idan ka zaɓi yin amfani da wurin gida kawai don takardun taimakon shafi, duba wannan akwatin zaɓin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Tabbatar da Gogewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Tambayi mai amfani kafin goge abu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Saitin Kiyaye Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Idan an kunna, Kadupul zai saita Maɓallin Rediyo don Share Tushen Bayanai masu alaƙa na Jadawali yayin cire Jadawalai.  Lura: Kadupul ba zai ba da izinin cire Tushen Bayanai ba idan ana amfani da su a wasu Jadawalai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Buɗe Jadawalai Kai Tsaye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Idan an kunna, Kadupul ba zai kulle Jadawalai ba.  Wannan yana ba da damar gyara Tushen Bayanai masu alaƙa da Jadawali da sauri da hannu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Kadupul Dashboard"
msgstr "Ɓoye Allon Kadupul"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Kadupul's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Kadupul Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Don amfani da Tallafin Haɗin Waje na Kadupul. Ta amfani da wannan saitin, za ku iya ɓoye Allon Kadupul, domin nuna shafinku kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Kunna Ja-Ka-Sake"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Kadupul's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Wasu daga cikin fuskokin Kadupul suna goyon bayan Ja-ka-Ajiye (Drag-N-Drop).  Idan an zaɓa za a kunna wannan zaɓin.  Lura: Ga masu amfani da ke da nakasar gani, za a iya kashe wannan zaɓin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Tsaron Wuri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Tilasta Haɗi ta HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Kadupul will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓa, duk wani yunƙurin shiga Kadupul za a tura shi zuwa HTTPS don tabbatar da tsaro mai ƙarfi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Bada Damar HTTPS Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa Mara Aminci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Bada damar amfani da Takaddun Shaidar da Aka Sanya wa Hannu da Kai kuma bada damar sunan mai masaukin baki na Takardar Shaida ya bambanta da na Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Bada Damar Haruffa Masu Haɗari a Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "A tarihi, masu gudanar da Kadupul sun ƙirƙiri Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai masu sauƙi da suka haɗa da umarni kamar \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" don wakiltar lamba da za a yi amfani da ita a Jadawalan Kadupul. A tsofaffin nau'ikan Kadupul, an ba da izinin wannan. Duk da haka, wannan hanya ce mara tsaro domin tana buɗe ƙofa ga masu amfani na waje su wallafa Samfuran Bayanai marasa tsaro. A cikin Kadupul na zamani, ya kamata a guji irin waɗannan hanyoyi. Duk da haka, mun samar da wannan zaɓin idan kuna da tsofaffin Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai waɗanda ke ƙunshe da waɗannan Meta Characters marasa tsaro kuma ba ku canja su zuwa rubutun gida a cikin kundin 'scripts' ba. Idan ba a zaɓi wannan zaɓin ba, Kadupul yana hana haruffan shell kamar alamun zance, baka masu lanƙwasa, layuka a tsaye, backslash, da backticks. Kadupul yana ci gaba da ba da izinin alamun fiye da da ƙasa da don abubuwa kamar <path_cacti> da sigogin shigarwa, amma idan ba a zaɓi wannan zaɓin ba, nan ne iyakar amfanin da aka yarda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Tsarin Rubutun Tsaron Abun Ciki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy. The Nonce Mode - Reporting Only choice reports inline scripts that lack a nonce without blocking them. The implementation also supports an enforcing nonce mode through direct configuration, but this mode is not offered here because many built-in pages and plugins still use inline scripts without nonces. Enabling enforcement before those scripts are migrated can break pages and plugins. Use CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute() when adding inline scripts."
msgstr "Yana sarrafa tsarin script-src CSP. Zaɓin Yanayin Nonce - Rahoto Kawai yana ba da rahoton rubutun ciki waɗanda ba su da nonce ba tare da toshe su ba. Aiwatarwar tana kuma goyan bayan yanayin nonce mai tilastawa ta hanyar saiti kai tsaye, amma ba a bayar da wannan yanayin a nan ba saboda yawancin shafuka na ciki da plugins har yanzu suna amfani da rubutun ciki ba tare da nonces ba. Kunna tilastawa kafin a ƙaura da waɗannan rubutun na iya karya shafuka da plugins. Yi amfani da CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute() lokacin ƙara rubutun ciki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Bada Damar JavaScript na Ciki Mara Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Bada damar unsafe-eval da JavaScript na Ciki Mara Nonce duka biyu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Yanayin Nonce - Rahoto Kawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI na Rahoton Keta CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL inda burauzoshi ke tura rahotannin keta CSP a yanayin nonce-report da nonce. Bar shi fanko don amfani da <url_path>/csp_report.php. Dole ne ya ƙunshi haruffan URL masu lafiya kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Madadin Tushen Tsaron Abun Ciki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Sunayen yankuna (domain) da aka raba da sarari waɗanda za a ba su izinin shiga wajen Sabar Yanar Gizon kanta.  Wannan yana da muhimmanci ga masu amfani da suka zaɓi yin amfani da CDN, ko shafin baƙunci.  Tushe na iya haɗawa da alamun wildcards misali: *.mydomain.com, ko ƙa'ida, misali: https://*.example.com.  Waɗannan Madadin Tushe sun haɗa da nau'ikan Hoto, CSS da JavaScript kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL inda burauzoshi ke tura rahotannin keta CSP a yanayin nonce-report da nonce. Bar shi fanko don amfani da /cacti/csp_report.php a tushen shigarwa. Dole ne ya ƙunshi haruffan URL masu lafiya kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Kunna Ƙirƙirar Jadawali Ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Idan an kashe, Sarrafa Kai tsaye na Kadupul ba zai ƙirƙiri wani Jadawali da gangan ba.  Wannan yana da amfani yayin daidaita saitunan Na'ura don guje wa ƙirƙirar sabbin Jadawalai duk lokacin da ka ajiye abu.  Kiran Ƙa'idojin Sarrafa Kai tsaye da hannu zai ci gaba da yiwuwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Kunna Ƙirƙirar Abun Bishiya Ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Idan an kashe, Sarrafa Kai tsaye na Kadupul ba zai ƙirƙiri wani Abun Bishiya da gangan ba.  Wannan yana da amfani yayin daidaita saitunan Na'ura ko Jadawali don guje wa ƙirƙirar sabbin Shigarwar Bishiya duk lokacin da ka ajiye abu.  Kiran Ƙa'idoji da hannu zai ci gaba da yiwuwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Imel na Zuwa don Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the Primary Kadupul Admins Email account."
msgstr "Adireshin Imel da za a aika da Imel ɗin Sanarwar Sarrafa Kai tsaye zuwa gare shi idan ba a bayyana a matakin Cibiyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kai tsaye ba.  Idan an bar wannan filin, ko ƙimar Cibiyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kai tsaye fanko, Kadupul zai yi amfani da asusun Imel na Babban Mai Gudanar da Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Sunan Daga don Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Sunan Imel da za a yi amfani da shi don Imel ɗin Sanarwar Sarrafa Kai tsaye idan ba a bayyana a matakin Cibiyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kai tsaye ba.  Idan an bar wannan filin, ko ƙimar Cibiyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kai tsaye fanko, Kadupul zai yi amfani da Sunan Daga (From) na asali na tsarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Imel na Daga don Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Kadupul will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Adireshin Imel da za a yi amfani da shi don Imel ɗin Sanarwar Sarrafa Kai tsaye idan ba a bayyana a matakin Cibiyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kai tsaye ba.  Idan an bar wannan filin, ko ƙimar Cibiyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kai tsaye fanko, Kadupul zai yi amfani da Adireshin Imel na Daga (From) na asali na tsarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Saitunan Asali na Samfurin Jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Tushen Bayanan Gwaji na Samfurin Jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Duba wannan akwatin zaɓin idan kana son gwada Tushen Bayanai kafin ƙirƙirar su don sababbi da sababbin Samfuran Jadawali da aka shigo da su. Tare da kunna Gwada Tushen Bayanai, idan Tushen Bayanai bai dawo da bayanai masu inganci ba, ba za a ƙirƙiri Jadawalin ba. Wannan saitin yana da muhimmanci idan kana son samun Samfurin Na'ura mafi gama-gari wanda zai iya haɗawa da ƙarin Samfuran Jadawali waɗanda za a iya amfani da su a zaɓe ya danganta da halayen Na'urar kanta. Lura: Idan kana da rubutun umarni mai daɗewa a matsayin Tushen Bayanai, lokacin ƙirƙirar Jadawalai zai ƙaru."

