msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Nau'in Ping na Asali ga duk sababbin Na'urori.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Kadupul will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Kadupul requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Tashar Ping ta Asali ga duk sababbin Na'urori. Tare da TCP, Kadupul zai yi ƙoƙarin Syn tashar. Tare da UDP, Kadupul yana buƙatar ko dai haɗi mai nasara, ko kuskuren 'ba za a iya kai wa tasha ba' don tantance ko Na'urar tana sama ko a'a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Ƙimar Ƙarewar Lokacin Ping ta Asali a cikin milli-seconds ga duk sababbin Na'urori. Ƙimomin ƙarewar lokaci da za a yi amfani da su don SNMP, ICMP, UDP da TCP pinging na Na'ura. Za a zagaye ICMP Pings zuwa daƙiƙa mafi kusa. Tsarin aiki ne ke sarrafa ƙarewar lokacin haɗin TCP da UDP a Windows, saboda haka ba a ba da shawarar su a Windows ba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Kadupul will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Adadin lokutan da Kadupul zai yi ƙoƙarin yin ping ga Na'ura kafin ya sanya ta a matsayin a kashe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Up/Down Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Kunne/Kashe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failure Count"
msgstr "Adadin Gazawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Adadin tazarar tattarawa da Na'ura za ta kasance a kashe kafin a rubuta kuskure da bayar da rahoton Na'ura a matsayin a kashe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Recovery Count"
msgstr "Adadin Farfaɗowa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Adadin tazarar tattarawa da Na'ura za ta kasance a kunne kafin a mayar da Na'ura zuwa matsayin a kunne da bayar da sanarwa."

