#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Graph Timespan"
msgstr "Tsawon Lokacin Jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Wannan tsawon lokacin da kake son gani a kan jadawali na asali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Mafi Ƙarancin Tazarar Sabuntawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne mafi ƙanƙantar lokacin da ake tallafawa tsakanin sabuntawar Jadawali.  Ana kuma amfani da wannan ƙimar don saita wasu halayen RRDfile.  Idan kana da Na'urar da ke adana bayanai na wucin gadi kuma ba ta ba da sabuntawa na lokaci-kai-tsaye ba, za ka iya ƙara Tazarar Sabuntawa Mafi Ƙanƙanta ta asali don hana ƙirƙirar Jadawalai masu giɓi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cache Directory"
msgstr "Kundin Cache"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Wannan shi ne wurin, a kan sabar yanar gizo inda za a adana fayilolin RRDfiles da PNG na wucin gadi.  Poller zai sarrafa wannan ma'ajiyar.  Tabbatar kana da izinin karatu da rubutu masu dacewa a kan wannan babban fayil ɗin"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Graph Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Jadawalin RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Watermark"
msgstr "Alamar Ruwa ta Musamman"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Text placed at the bottom center of every Graph."
msgstr "Rubutun da ake sanyawa a ƙasan tsakiyar kowane Jadawali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Custom Date Format"
msgstr "Tsarin Kwanan Wata na Musamman"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To be used when formatting |date_time| on a graph"
msgstr "Don amfani da shi yayin tsara |date_time| a kan jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable RRDtool Watermark"
msgstr "Kashe Alamar Ruwa ta RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Provided your RRDtool version supports it, you may disable RRDtool advertisement on your Graphs by checking this option."
msgstr "Muddin nau'in RRDtool ɗinka yana tallafa masa, za ka iya kashe tallan RRDtool a kan Jadawalan ka ta hanyar duba wannan zaɓin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Font Selection Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Zaɓar Nau'in Rubutu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How do you wish fonts to be handled by default?"
msgstr "Yaya kuke son a sarrafa nau'ikan rubutu ta asali?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/api_device.php
msgid "System"
msgstr "Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Font"
msgstr "Font na Asali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Lokacin da ba a amfani da sarrafa rubutu bisa Jigo, bayanin nau'in rubutun Pango don amfani da shi ga dukkan Jadawalai, kamar DejaVu Sans. A zaɓinka, za ka iya barin shi fanko kuma ka sarrafa saitunan rubutu ga kowane abu daban."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Sa'o'in Aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Farawar Ranar Aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Lokacin da sa'o'in aikinka ke farawa. Tsari: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Ƙarshen Ranar Aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Lokacin da sa'o'in aikinka ke ƙarewa. Tsari: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Ɓoye Karshen Mako"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Nuna sa'o'in kasuwanci a ranakun aiki kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Nuna sa'o'in aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Nuna sa'o'in aiki a kan jadawalan rrd."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Launi da za a yi amfani da shi don sa'o'in aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Launin da za a nuna don sa'o'in aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Matsakaicin adadin kwanaki don nuna sa'o'in kasuwanci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Bayan wannan adadin kwanaki, ba za a ƙara sa'o'in aiki a kan jadawalin ba. <br/>Abinda aka ba da shawara: kwanaki 62"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "An Kunna Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Idan kana son dakatar da tsarin polling gaba ɗaya, cire zaɓin wannan akwatin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "An Kunna Tallafin SNMP Agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Idan an duba wannan zaɓin, Kadupul zai cika teburan SNMP Agent da bayanan na'ura da tsarin Kadupul. Ba ya kunna SNMP Agent da kansa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Nau'in poller da za a yi amfani da shi.  Wannan saitin zai fara aiki a tazarar tattarawa ta gaba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Daidaitawar Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Tazarar daidaita tattarawa ta asali da za a yi amfani da ita yayin ƙirƙirar poller.  Wannan saitin zai shafi yadda ake dubawa da sabunta pollers na nesa akai-akai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Tazarar tattarawa da ake amfani da ita.  Wannan saitin zai shafi yadda ake dubawa da sabunta RRDfiles akai-akai.  <strong><u>LURA: Idan ka canza wannan ƙimar, dole ne ka sake cika ma'ajiyar poller.  Rashin yin hakan na iya haifar da asarar bayanai.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Yawan lokacin da za a fara mai tara bayanai na Kadupul.  Za ka iya amfani da ko dai crontab, aikin da aka tsara (don windows), ko sabis ɗin systemd na cactid don sarrafa kunna mai tara bayanai na Kadupul.  Don umarni kan amfani da daemon ɗin cactid, duba fayil ɗin README.md a cikin kundin sabis."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Daidaita Nauyin Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Kadupul zai yi ƙoƙarin daidaita nauyin kowane tsarin poller ta hanyar raba abubuwan poller daidai a kowane tsari."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Faɗin Fitarwar Debug"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Kadupul zai duba fitarwar da ta wuce ƙarfin Kadupul na adana ta kuma ya ba da gargaɗi idan ya same ta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Kashe Binciken Ƙaruwar OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Yana sarrafa kashe bincike don ƙaruwar OID yayin zagayen bishiyar OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Wakili na Nesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Adadin lokaci, cikin sakan, da sabar yanar gizo ta Tsakiya ta Kadupul za ta jira amsa daga Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa don samun bayanan Na'ura daban-daban kafin ta watsar da buƙatar.  A kan Na'urorin da ke da alaƙa da Masu Tara Bayanai ban da Mai Tara Bayanai na Tsakiya na Kadupul, dole ne a yi amfani da Wakilin Nesa don tattara bayanan Na'ura."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Girman Ɗaukar SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "OIDs nawa ya kamata a dawo da su a kowace buƙatar snmpbulkwalk? Ga Na'urori masu manyan bishiyoyin SNMP, ƙara wannan girman zai ƙara saurin sake fihirisa a kan WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Iyakar OID na SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Mafi girman adadin SNMP Get OIDs na asali da za a bayar a kowace buƙatar snmpget.  Ga Na'urori, ana sarrafa wannan saitin a matakin Na'ura.  Ya kamata ka yi amfani da wannan saitin ne kawai lokacin amfani da SNMP API na Kadupul kai tsaye a cikin scripts ko plugins ɗinka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Retention"
msgstr "Riƙe Samfuran da Aka Ƙi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Sa'o'in da samfuran da RRDtool ya ƙi, misali bayan canjin tsarin tushen bayanai, suke zama cikin layin jira don sake gwadawa kafin a mayar da su zuwa teburin poller_output_rejected. Gyara RRDfile, sannan ka gudanar da cli/replay_rejected_samples.php don sarrafa su."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Limit"
msgstr "Iyakar Samfuran da Aka Ƙi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Mafi yawan samfuran da aka ƙi waɗanda tushen bayanai guda ɗaya zai iya riƙe a layi.  Ana matsar da tsofaffin samfuran da suka wuce wannan iyaka zuwa teburin poller_output_rejected nan take."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Kashe Kwafin Cache na Albarkatu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ta hanyar asali, babban Mai Tattara Bayanai na Kadupul zai adana duka shafin yanar gizo da plugins a cikin Resource Cache. Sannan, lokaci-lokaci Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa za su sabunta kansu da duk wani sabuntawa daga babban Mai Tattara Bayanai na Kadupul. Wannan Resource Cache yana ba Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa damar haɓaka kansu. Idan ba ka son amfani da wannan zaɓin, za ka iya kashe shi ta amfani da wannan saitin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Ƙarin Saitunan Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Rajistar Bayanai Marasa Inganci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Yaya kuke son a rubuta kurakuran fitarwar Mai Tattara Bayanai? Zaɓuɓɓuka sun haɗa da: 'Detailed' wanda ke ba da bayanin kowane kuskure, 'Summary' wanda ke ba da adadin kurakuran fitarwa a kowace Na'ura, da 'None', wanda ba ya ba da adadin kurakurai."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Taƙaitawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Cikakken Bayani"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Adadin Sabobin Rubutun PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Adadin tsarukan sabar script na lokaci guda da za a gudanar a kowane tsarin spine.  Ana karɓar saituna tsakanin 1 zuwa 15.  Wannan ma'aunin zai taimaka idan kana gudanar da zaren aiki da yawa da scripts na sabar script kuma yana aiki ne kawai ga Mai Tara Bayanai na spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Ƙimar Lokacin Karewar Script da Sabar Script"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Mafi girman lokacin da spine zai jira don script ya kammala.  Wannan ƙimar karewar lokaci tana cikin sakan kuma tana aiki ne kawai ga Mai Tara Bayanai na spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Sake Fihirisar Duk Na'urori Lokaci-Lokaci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Jadawalin Sake Fihirisar Duk Na'urori"

#: include/global_settings.php
