#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Saitunan Asali na Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ana kula da waɗannan saituna a matakin Mai Tara Bayanai.  Ƙimomin da ke nan abubuwa ne na asali kawai da ake amfani da su lokacin fara ƙirƙirar Mai Tara Bayanai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Tsarukan Aiki na Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Adadin tsaruka na lokaci guda na asali da za a gudanar a kowane Mai Tara Bayanai.  LURA: Tun daga Kadupul 1.2, ana kula da wannan saitin a cikin Mai Tara Bayanai.  Ci gaba, wannan ƙimar saiti ne kawai don Mai Tara Bayanai.  Amfani da lamba mafi girma lokacin amfani da cmd.php zai inganta aiki.  Inganta aiki a cikin Spine ya fi kyau a magance shi da ma'aunin threads.  Lokacin amfani da Spine, muna ba da shawarar lamba ƙarama kuma a yi amfani da threads maimakon haka.  Lokacin amfani da cmd.php, kar a yi amfani da fiye da 2x na adadin cibiyoyin CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Zaren Aiki a Kowane Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Zaren Aiki na Asali (Default Threads) da aka ba da izini a kowane tsari.  LURA: Tun daga Kadupul 1.2+, ana kula da wannan saitin a cikin Mai Tara Bayanai, kuma wannan kawai Saitin da Aka Shirya ne.  Amfani da lamba mafi girma lokacin amfani da Spine zai inganta aiki.  Duk da haka, tabbatar kana da isassun haɗin MySQL/MariaDB don tallafa wa wannan lissafin: connections = masu tara bayanai * tsaruka * (threads + sabobin script).  Haka kuma dole ne ka tabbatar kana da isassun ragowar haɗin don haɗin shigar masu amfani."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Tabbatarwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Tabbatarwa ta Ciki</i> - Kadupul tana kula da tabbatar da mai amfani, wanda ke ba ka damar ƙirƙirar masu amfani da ba su haƙƙoƙi zuwa sassa daban-daban a cikin Kadupul.<br><br><i>Tabbatarwa ta Yanar Gizo ta Asali</i> - Sabar yanar gizo ce ke kula da tabbatarwa. Za a iya ƙara ko ƙirƙirar masu amfani ta atomatik a shiga na farko idan an ayyana Mai Amfani na Samfuri, in ba haka ba za a yi amfani da izinin baƙo da aka ayyana.<br><br><i>Tabbatarwar LDAP</i> - Yana ba da damar tabbatarwa a kan sabar LDAP. Za a ƙirƙiri masu amfani ta atomatik a shiga na farko idan an ayyana Mai Amfani na Samfuri, in ba haka ba za a yi amfani da izinin baƙo da aka ayyana. Idan ba a kunna tsarin LDAP na PHP ba, Tabbatarwar LDAP ba za ta bayyana a matsayin zaɓi ba.<br><br><i>Tabbatarwar Yankin LDAP/AD Masu Yawa</i> - Yana ba masu gudanarwa damar tallafawa ƙungiyoyi daban-daban da yawa daga kundayen adireshi na LDAP/AD daban-daban don samun damar albarkatun Kadupul. Kamar Tabbatarwar LDAP, ana buƙatar tsarin LDAP na PHP don amfani da wannan hanyar.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Tallafa wa Kukis na Tantancewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Idan mai amfani ya tantance kansa kuma ya zaɓi 'Keep me signed in', za a ƙirƙiri authentication cookie a kwamfutar mai amfani wanda zai ba shi damar ci gaba da kasancewa a ciki. Authentication cookie yana ƙarewa bayan kwanaki 90 ba tare da amfani ba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Masu Amfani na Musamman"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Babban Mai Gudanarwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Sunan babban asusun gudanarwa wanda zai karɓi Imel ta atomatik lokacin da tsarin Kadupul ya fuskanci matsaloli.  Don karɓar waɗannan Imel ɗin, tabbatar saitunan saƙonka sun yi daidai, kuma asusun gudanarwa yana da adireshin Imel da aka saita."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
