msgstr "Wannan zai buƙaci sabbin kalmomin sirri su ƙunshi aƙalla alama ta musamman 1."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Tilasta Tsananin Tsaro a Kan Tsofaffin Kalmomin Sirri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Wannan zai buƙaci dukkan tsofaffin kalmomin sirri su ma su cika sabbin buƙatun sarƙaƙiya yayin shiga.  Idan ba su cika ba, zai tilasta sauya kalmar sirri."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Ƙare Asusun da Ba Sa Aiki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne mafi girman adadin kwanaki kafin a kashe asusun da ba sa aiki.  An keɓe asusun Admin daga wannan manufa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Ƙare Kalmar Sirri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne mafi girman adadin kwanaki kafin kalmar sirri ta ƙare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Tarihin Kalmar Sirri"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Riƙe wannan adadin tsofaffin kalmomin sirri kuma hana sake amfani da su."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "Canji 1"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "Canje-canje %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Kulle Asusu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Kulle Asusu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Kulle asusu bayan wannan adadin yunƙurin da suka gaza a cikin sa'a 1."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "Yunƙuri 1"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "Yunƙuri %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Buɗewa Ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Za a buɗe asusu ta atomatik bayan waɗannan mintuna. Ko da an shigar da kalmar sirri daidai, ba za a buɗe asusun ba har sai an cika wannan iyakar lokacin. Matsakaicin mintuna 1440 (Rana 1)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "Rana 1"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan LDAP Gaba ɗaya"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Sabar(ori)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP address of for valid LDAP servers.  Kadupul will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "Jerin sunayen mai masaukin baki na DNS ko adireshin IP da aka raba da sarari don sabar LDAP masu aiki. Kadupul zai yi ƙoƙarin amfani da sabar LDAP daga hagu zuwa dama don tabbatar da mai amfani."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Tasha Ta Yau da Kullum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "Tashar TCP don sadarwar da ba SSL ba ciki har da LDAP + TLS.  Na asali shi ne 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "Tashar SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "Tashar TCP don LDAPS don sadarwar SSL.  Na asali shi ne 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Nau'in Ka'ida"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Nau'in Ka'ida don haɗawa da sabar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Haɗawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Lokacin Karewar Haɗin Cibiyar Sadarwa cikin sakan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Haɗawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Lokacin Karewar Haɗi (Bind Timeout) cikin sakan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "Yanayin Gyaran Kuskuren LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Idan An Zaɓa Kadupul zai rubuta ƙarin bayanan LDAP zuwa rajistar Kadupul yayin ayyukan Binding da Bincike."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Ɓoyewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Ɓoyewa da sabar ke goyan baya. LURA: Lokacin amfani da LDAP + TLS dole ne ka yi amfani da sigar 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Buƙatun Takardar Shaidar TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client.  Demand and Hard refuse a server whose certificate does not verify.  Never and Allow skip that check, so anyone on the network path can pose as the directory and read the passwords sent to it."
msgstr "Shin LDAP ya tabbatar da Takaddun Shaidar TLS lokacin da Abokin Ciniki ya karɓa.  Demand da Hard suna ƙin sabar da takardar shaidarta ba ta tabbata ba.  Never da Allow suna tsallake wannan binciken, don haka duk wanda ke kan hanyar sadarwa zai iya yin kama da kundin adireshi kuma ya karanta kalmomin sirrin da aka aika masa."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Referrals"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Kunna ko Kashe tura LDAP. Idan an kashe, yana iya ƙara saurin bincike."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Yanayi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Yanayin da cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin tantancewa a sabar LDAP.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - Babu binciken Distinguished Name (DN) da zai faru, kawai yunƙurin haɗawa da tsarin Distinguished Name (DN) da aka bayar.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Yana ƙoƙarin bincika sunan mai amfani a kundin LDAP ta hanyar haɗin da ba a bayyana suna ba don gano Distinguished Name (DN) na mai amfani.<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Yana ƙoƙarin bincika sunan mai amfani a kundin LDAP ta hanyar Specific Distinguished Name (DN) da Specific Password don haɗawa da gano Distinguished Name (DN) na mai amfani."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Sunan da Aka Bambance (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Tsarin \"Distinguished Name\", wanda ya dace da saitunan OpenLDAP da Windows AD, yana ba da sassauci wajen bayyana shaidar mai amfani. Ga OpenLDAP, tsarin yana bin wannan tsari: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD yana ba da wani tsari daban: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, wanda aka fi sani da \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". A cikin wannan mahallin, \"&lt;username&gt;\" yana wakiltar takamaiman sunan mai amfani da aka bayar yayin shiga. Wannan yana da matuƙar muhimmanci musamman lokacin da ake aiki a yanayin \"No Searching\", ko lokacin da aka kunna \"Require Group Membership\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Buƙaci Kasancewar Mamba a Rukuni"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Buƙaci mai amfani ya kasance mamba na rukuni don tantancewa. Dole ne a saita saitunan rukuni don wannan ya yi aiki, kunnawa ba tare da ingantattun saitunan rukuni ba zai haifar da gazawar tantancewa."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Rukunin LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Sunan da Aka Bambance na ƙungiyar da mai amfani dole ne ya kasance memba."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Siffar Mamba na Rukuni"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Wannan yana nufin takamaiman sifa a cikin kundin adireshin LDAP wanda ke riƙe da sunayen masu amfani na membobin rukuni. Yana da matuƙar muhimmanci a tabbatar da cewa ƙimar sifar ta yi daidai da saitin da aka bayyana a cikin \"Distinguished Name\" ko kuma ana iya bincika ainihin ƙimar sifar ta amfani da saitunan da aka zayyana a cikin \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
