#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Kunna Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Kadupul?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Shin Boost ya kunna sabunta RRD idan an buƙata a cikin Kadupul?  Idan ka kashe, wannan sauyin ba zai fara aiki ba sai bayan zagayen tattarawa na gaba.  Idan kana da Masu Tara Bayanai na Nesa, ana buƙatar wannan saitin ya kasance a kunne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Mai Sabunta RRD na Matakin Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Kafin a Share Sabuntawar RRD Bisa Buƙata, dole ne gudanar da poller ya wuce koyaushe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Sau Nawa Ya Kamata Boost Ya Sabunta Duk RRDs"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Lokacin da ka kunna boost, ana sabunta fayilolin RRD naka ne kawai lokacin da mai amfani ya neme su, ko lokacin da wannan lokacin ya cika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Adadin Ayyukan Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Adadin tsarukan boost na lokaci guda da za a yi amfani da su don sarrafa dukkan RRDs a cikin teburin boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Processing Mode"
msgstr "Yanayin Sarrafa Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Yadda Boost ke rarraba sabunta RRD. Tsarin ayyuka masu rarrabuwa suna fara adadin ayyukan Boost da ke sama a kowane gudu. Ma'aikatan layin saƙo suna miƙa kowane yanki ga ma'aikatan Messenger a maimakon haka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Forked processes"
msgstr "Tsarin ayyuka masu rarrabuwa (Forked processes)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Message queue workers"
msgstr "Ma'aikatan layin saƙo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Matsakaicin Rikodi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Idan teburin fitarwar boost ya wuce wannan girman, a cikin rikodi, za a yi sabuntawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Matsakaicin Abubuwan Tushen Bayanai a Kowane Zagaye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Don inganta aiki, mai sabunta RRD na boost yana buƙatar sanin adadin Abubuwan Tushen Bayanai da za a dawo da su a zagaye ɗaya.  Da fatan za a kula kar a saita da yawa domin aikin zana jadawali yayin manyan sabuntawa na iya lalacewa.  Idan ka fuskanci jinkirin zana jadawali ko tattarawa yayin sabuntawa, rage wannan lambar.  Ƙimar asali ita ce 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Matsakaicin Tsawon Siga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Lokacin da boost ya aika umarnin sabuntawa zuwa RRDtool, bai kamata ya wuce Mafi Girman Tsayin Muhawara na tsarin aiki ba.  Wannan ya bambanta ta tsarin aiki da matakin kernel.  Misali: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ marar iyaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Iyakar Memory na Boost da Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Mafi girman adadin ƙwaƙwalwa (memory) don Kadupul Poller da Boosts Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Matsakaicin Lokacin Gudanar da Rubutun Sabunta RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Idan boost poller ya wuce wannan lokacin aiki, za a sanya gargaɗi a cikin cacti log,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "Kunna cika teburin poller_output_boost kai tsaye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost with results in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr "Yana kunna shigar da bayanai kai tsaye cikin poller output boost wanda ke haifar da raguwar lokaci da kashi 25% a kowane zagayen bincike."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Log ɗin Debug na Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost\tpoller process."
msgstr "Idan wannan fagen ba fanko ba ne, Boost zai rubuta fitarwar RRDUpdate daga tsarin boost\tpoller."

