msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Kunna Hanyoyi Masu Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Yi amfani da ƙaramin babban fayil daban don fayilolin RRD na kowace uwar garke.  Sanya sunan RRDfiles zai zama ɗaya daga cikin waɗannan:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Za ka iya yin wannan sauyi bayan shigarwa ta hanyar gudanar da rubutun CLI <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> bayan ka yi sauyin.  LURA: Idan ka canza ƙimar Max Directories don rage adadin kundin adireshi, ko idan ka canza Tsarin Kundi, ba za a share kundin adireshi fanko ba bayan ka sake gudanar da rubutun <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Tsarin Kundi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Wane Tsarin Kundi kake son amfani da shi don Hanyoyin RRD Masu Tsari.  'Lambar Na'ura' ita ce ta asali.  Ya kamata a yi amfani da saitin 'Lambar Na'ura/Lambar Tambayar Bayanai' lokacin da kake da Na'urori masu dubban Jadawalai.  Bayan Canza Tsarin Kundi, dole ne ka sake gudanar da rubutun CLI na Tsarin Hanya don gyara hanyoyin RRDfile zuwa sabon Tsarin."

