#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Kawar da Spike"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Cirewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin cirewa guda biyu.  Na farko, Karkatarwa ta Daidaito (Standard Deviation), zai cire duk wani samfuri da ya yi nisa da adadin X na karkatarwa ta daidaito daga matsakaicin samfura.  Hanya ta biyu, Variance, za ta cire duk wani samfuri da ya fi matsakaicin Variance da X%.  Hanyar Variance tana la'akari da wani adadi na 'masu fita daban' (outliers).  Waɗannan samfura ne na musamman, kamar spike, waɗanda ke buƙatar a cire su daga lissafin Matsakaicin Variance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Karkatarwa ta Daidaito (Standard Deviation)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Bisa Variance Tare da Cire Outliers"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Maye Gurbi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin maye gurbi guda uku.  Hanyar farko tana maye gurbin spike da matsakaicin tushen bayanan da ake magana a kai.  Hanya ta biyu tana maye gurbin spike da 'NaN'.  Ta ƙarshe tana maye gurbin spike da ƙima mai kyau ta ƙarshe da aka samu."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Matsakaici"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN's"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Mai Kyau na Ƙarshe da Aka Sani"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Adadin Standard Deviations"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Duk ƙimar da ta fi matsakaici da waɗannan karkatattun ma'aunai za a cire ta. Lamba mai kyau za ta dogara ne da nau'in bayanan da za a yi aiki a kai. Muna ba da shawarar lamba da ba ta gaza Karkatattun Ma'aunai 5 ba."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Karkatattun Ma'aunai %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Kashi na Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Wannan ƙimar tana wakiltar kashi sama da matsakaicin samfurin da aka daidaita da zarar an cire outliers daga samfurin.  Misali, Kashi na Variance na 100%% akan matsakaicin da aka daidaita na 50 zai cire duk wani samfuri da ya wuce adadin 100 daga jadawalin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Adadin Outliers na Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Wannan ƙimar tana wakiltar adadin matsakaicin samfuran sama da ƙasa da za a cire daga rukunin samfuran kafin ƙididdige Matsakaicin Variance.  Idan ka zaɓi ƙimar outlier ta 5, to za a cire matsakaicin 5 na sama da 5 na ƙasa duka."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "Samfurin Sama/Ƙasa %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Matsakaicin Kashewa a Kowane RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Wannan ƙimar tana wakiltar mafi girman adadin spikes da za a cire daga Jadawalin RRA."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "Haɓaka %d"

