#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Kadupul server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Kadupul database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Yana da matuƙar muhimmanci Babban Sabar Kadupul ta iya sadarwa ta MySQL zuwa kowace sabar rumbun bayanai ta Kadupul ta nesa. Da zarar an kammala shigarwa, dole ne ka gyara Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa kuma ka tabbatar saitunan sun yi daidai. Za ka iya tabbatarwa ta amfani da 'Gwada Haɗi' yayin gyara Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa."

