#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Da fatan za a tabbatar izinin kundin da ke ƙasa sun yi daidai kafin ci gaba. Yayin shigarwa, waɗannan kundaye suna buƙatar kasancewa mallakin mai amfani na Sabar Yanar Gizo. Ana buƙatar waɗannan canje-canjen izini don ba wa Mai Shigarwa damar shigar da kunshe-kunshen Samfurin Na'ura waɗanda suka haɗa da fayilolin XML da na rubutu da za a sanya a cikin waɗannan kundaye. Idan ka zaɓi kada ka shigar da kunshe-kunshen, akwai rubutun cli na 'install_package.php' da za a iya amfani da shi daga layin umarni bayan an kammala shigarwar."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Bayan an kammala shigarwa, za ka iya sanya waɗannan kundayen su zama na karatu kawai don ƙara tsaro."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Kadupul remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Kadupul Web Site changes"
msgstr "Waɗannan kundin adireshi za a buƙaci su kasance a buɗe don karatu da rubutu bayan shigarwa domin tsarin daidaitawar nesa na Kadupul ya sabunta su yayin da Babban Shafin Yanar Gizon Kadupul ya canja"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Idan kana shigar da kunshe-kunshe, da zarar an shigar da kunshe-kunshen, ya kamata ka mayar da kundin scripts zuwa karatu kawai domin wannan yana kawo wani haɗari ga shafin yanar gizon."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ga masu tattara bayanai na nesa, yana da matuƙar muhimmanci hanyoyin da za ku riƙa sabuntawa akai-akai, ciki har da hanyoyin plugins, scripts, da resources, su kasance da izinin karatu/rubutu domin mai tattara bayanai zai sabunta waɗannan hanyoyi daga babban abun cikin sabar yanar gizo."

