#, php-format
msgid "%d Data Sources have an RRDfile path outside the RRA directory. This version only creates and updates RRDfiles inside the RRA directory or a directory listed in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, so these Data Sources will stop updating until one of the following is done:"
msgstr "Tushen Bayanai %d suna da hanyar RRDfile a wajen kundin RRA. Wannan sigar tana ƙirƙira da sabunta RRDfiles ne kawai a cikin kundin RRA ko wani kundi da aka jera a cikin $config['rrd_additional_paths'] a cikin include/config.php, saboda haka waɗannan Tushen Bayanan za su daina sabuntawa har sai an yi ɗaya daga cikin waɗannan:"

