#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Or move them into the RRA directory with structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: stop the poller, list their directory in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] so the script accepts them, run it, then remove the entry. Do not move them by hand and clear the Data Source Path, which starts a new, empty RRDfile."
msgstr "Ko matsar da su cikin kundin RRA tare da structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: tsayar da poller, lissafa kundin su a cikin $config['rrd_additional_paths'] don rubutun ya karɓe su, gudanar da shi, sannan ka cire shigarwar. Kada ka matsar da su da hannu ka share Hanyar Tushen Bayanai, wanda ke fara sabon RRDfile fanko."

