#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Kariyar Tabbatar da Shigarwa ta Whitelist"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Kadupul Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Kadupul poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai na Kadupul da ke kiran rubutu za a iya yin amfani da su ta hanyar da wanda ba mai gudanarwa ba zai iya lalata fayilolin da asusun poller ya mallaka, kuma a lokutan da wani ke gudanar da Kadupul poller a matsayin root, zai iya lalata tsarin aiki ta hanyar ba wa mahara damar kutse cikin kayayyakin aikin ku."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Kadupul was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Kadupul more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Kadupul administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Saboda haka, shekaru da yawa da suka wuce, an inganta Kadupul don samar da damar Whitelist a kan waɗannan nau'ikan Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai.  Ko da yake wannan yana tsare Kadupul sosai, yana ƙara yawan aikin da mai gudanar da Kadupul ke buƙata don shigo da sarrafa Samfura da Kunshi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Yadda Jerin Izini (Whitelisting) ke aiki shi ne lokacin da ka fara shigo da Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai, ko ka sake shigo da Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai, kuma script da ko muhawara suka canja ta kowace hanya, za a kashe Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai, da dukkan Tushen Bayanan da suka dace nan take har sai mai gudanarwa ya tabbatar da cewa Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai tana da inganci."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Kadupul's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Don sauƙaƙa gano Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai a wannan yanayi, mun tanadi rubutun tabbatarwa a cikin kundin CLI na Kadupul wanda za a iya gudanar da shi tare da zaɓuɓɓuka masu zuwa:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin script zai binciki duk wata Hanyar Shigar da Bayanai da aka haramta a halin yanzu kuma ya ba da cikakken bayani kan dalilin."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin script yana cire haramci a kan Hanyoyin Shigar da Bayanai da aka haramta a halin yanzu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin script zai sake kunna duk wani Tushen Bayanai da aka kashe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Ana ba da shawara sosai cewa ka sabunta config.php ɗinka don kunna wannan fasalin ta hanyar cire comment a kan <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable sannan ka gudanar da zaɓuɓɓukan rubutun CLI guda uku da ke sama bayan an kammala shigarwa ta yanar gizo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Duba Akwatin Zaɓi da ke ƙasa don tabbatar da cewa ka karanta kuma ka fahimci wannan damuwar tsaro"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Na karanta wannan bayani"

