msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Bayanin Tsari na Asali"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Kadupul Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Da fatan za a zaɓi Bayanin Tsarin Tushen Bayanai na asali da za a yi amfani da shi don tusoshin polling. Wannan shine matsakaicin lokaci tsakanin binciken na'urori don bayanai don haka ƙarancin tazarar polling, ƙarin aikin da ke kan mai masaukin Sabar Kadupul. Haka kuma, zaɓi tazarar Cron da aka yi niyya ko aka saita wanda kake son amfani da shi don Tattara Bayanai."

