#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MySQL 5.6+ da MariaDB 10.0+ kyawawan nau'ika ne, kuma suna da kyau sosai a zaɓe su. Tabbatar kana gudanar da sabon nau'in ƙarshe wanda ke gyara tsohuwar matsalar hanyar sadarwa ta ƙasa wadda ke jawo wa spine matsaloli da yawa tare da dogaro."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Ana BA DA SHAWARA SOSAI cewa ka kunna InnoDB a kowane nau'in %s da ya fi 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da Kadupul tare da harsuna ban da Turanci, yana da muhimmanci a yi amfani da nau'in haɗin haruffa na utf8mb4_unicode_ci domin wasu haruffa suna ɗaukar fiye da byte guda ɗaya."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da Kadupul tare da harsuna ban da Turanci, yana da muhimmanci a yi amfani da rukunin haruffa na utf8mb4 domin wasu haruffa suna ɗaukar fiye da byte guda ɗaya."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Ana ba da shawarar cewa ka kunna InnoDB a kowane nau'in %s da ya fi 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Ya danganta da adadin shiga da amfani da mai tattara bayanai na spine, %s zai buƙaci haɗin gwiwa da yawa. Lissafin spine shine: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), sannan dole ne ka bar sarari don haɗin gwiwar masu amfani, wanda zai canza ya danganta da adadin asusun shiga na lokaci guda."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Sanya cache na tebur ya fi girma yana nufin ƙarancin ayyukan buɗewa/rufe fayil lokacin amfani da innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Tare da damar tattarawa ta Nesa, za a daidaita bayanai masu yawa daga babbar sabar zuwa pollers na nesa.  Saboda haka, ajiye wannan ƙimar a ko sama da 16M."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Idan ana amfani da Kadupul Performance Booster kuma ana zaɓar injin ajiya na memory, dole ne a kula wajen zubar da buffer na Performance Booster kafin tsarin ya cika sararin teburin memory. Ana yin hakan ta hanyoyi biyu, na farko rage girman ginshiƙin fitarwa zuwa daidaitaccen girma. Wannan ginshiƙin yana cikin teburan poller_output, da poller_output_boost. Abu na biyu da za ka iya yi shine ware ƙarin memory ga teburan memory. Mun zaɓi ƙimar da aka ba da shawarar ta 10%% na memory na tsari, amma idan kana amfani da rumbun SSD, ko kana da ƙaramin tsari, za ka iya ƙyale wannan shawarar ko ka zaɓi wani injin ajiya daban. Za ka iya ganin yawan amfanin teburan Performance Booster a ƙarƙashin Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Yayin aiwatar da ƙananan tambayoyi (subqueries), samun girman tebur na wucin gadi mafi girma yana riƙe waɗannan teburan na wucin gadi a cikin ƙwaƙwalwa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Lokacin yin haɗawa (joins), idan suna ƙasa da wannan girman, za a riƙe su a cikin ƙwaƙwalwa kuma ba za a taɓa rubuta su zuwa fayil na wucin gadi ba.  Tunda wannan rabon ƙwaƙwalwa ne ga kowane haɗi, dole ne a yi taka-tsantsan kar a ƙara shi da yawa.  Jimillar join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Ainihin ƙwaƙwalwar MySQL/MariaDB ya kamata ta kasance ƙasa da 80%.  Idan shawarwarin ba ta da kyau (negative), dole ne ka rage wannan da ko sort_buffer_size har sai shawarwarin ta dace a cikin ƙwaƙwalwar da aka yarda."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da ajiyar InnoDB yana da muhimmanci a raba sararin teburanka daban.  Wannan yana sauƙaƙa sarrafa tebura ga masu amfani na dogon lokaci na %s.  Idan kana gudana da wannan a kashe a halin yanzu, za ka iya ƙaura zuwa ajiyar kowane fayil ta hanyar kunna wannan fasalin, sannan ka gudanar da umarnin alter a kan dukkan teburan InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da innodb_file_per_table, yana da muhimmanci a saita innodb_file_format zuwa Barracuda.  Wannan saitin zai ba da damar fihirisoshi masu tsayi masu muhimmanci ga wasu teburan Kadupul."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Idan teburan ka suna da manyan fihirisoshi sosai, dole ne ka yi aiki da Barracuda innodb_file_format kuma innodb_large_prefix ya zama daidai da 1. Rashin yin hakan na iya sa plugins ba su iya ƙirƙirar tebur yadda ya kamata ba."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB zai riƙe tebura da fihirisoshi da yawa a cikin memory na tsari gwargwadon iko. Saboda haka, ya kamata ka sa innodb_buffer_pool ya yi girma sosai don riƙe tebura da fihirisoshi da yawa a cikin memory. Duba girman kundin /var/lib/mysql/cacti zai taimaka wajen tantance wannan ƙimar. Muna ba da shawarar 25%% na jimlar memory na tsarin ku, amma buƙatun ku za su bambanta dangane da girman tsarin ku."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Kadupul instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Wannan saitin ya kamata ya kasance A KUNNE (ON) sai dai idan Kadupul ɗinka yana aiki a kan ZFS ko FusionI/O waɗanda dukansu suna da rajistar ciki don magance faɗuwar tsari kwatsam.  Duk da haka, idan kana da wutar lantarki mai kyau sosai, kuma tsarukanka ba sa kashewa da wuya kuma kana da ajiyar baya, kashe wannan saitin zuwa OFF na iya ba ka kusan ƙarin kashi 50% na saurin aikin rumbun bayanai."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne inda ake adana metadata. Idan kana da tebura da yawa, zai yi amfani a ƙara wannan."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Tambayoyi masu ɓarna ba su kamata su sa rumbun bayanai ya katse ga wasu ba. Kashe waɗannan tambayoyin kafin su kashe tsarin ka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Ana samun mafi girman aikin I/O lokacin da kake amfani da hanyar O_DIRECT don fitar da shafuka."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Saita wannan ƙimar zuwa 2 yana nufin za ka fitar da dukkan mu'amaloli a kowane sakan maimakon lokacin tabbatarwa.  Wannan yana ba %s damar yin rubutu sau da ƙasa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Tare da ajiyar nau'in SSD na zamani, samun zaren aiki na io da yawa yana da fa'ida ga manhajoji masu yawan halayen io."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Tun daga %s %s, za ka iya sarrafa sau nawa %s ke zubar da ma'amaloli zuwa faifai. Na asali shine daƙiƙa 1, amma a cikin tsarin I/O mai yawa saita ƙima sama da 1 na iya ba da damar I/O na faifai ya zama mai jeri"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Tare da ajiyar nau'in SSD na zamani, samun zaren aiki na karanta io da yawa yana da fa'ida ga manhajoji masu yawan halayen io.  Dangane da sigar MariaDB/MySQL naka, wannan ƙimar za ta iya kaiwa har 64.  Amma yi ƙoƙarin riƙe lambar ƙasa da jimillar zaren SMT naka a sabar rumbun bayanai."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Tare da ajiyar nau'in SSD na zamani, samun zaren aiki na rubuta io da yawa yana da fa'ida ga manhajoji masu yawan halayen io.  Dangane da sigar MariaDB/MySQL naka, wannan ƙimar za ta iya kaiwa har 64.  Amma yi ƙoƙarin riƙe lambar ƙasa da jimillar zaren SMT naka a sabar rumbun bayanai."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s zai raba innodb_buffer_pool zuwa yankunan ƙwaƙwalwa don inganta aiki ga sigogin MariaDB ƙasa da 10.5. Matsakaicin ƙima shine 64, amma bai kamata ya wuce adadin ƙwayoyin CPU/zarukan aiki ba. Lokacin da innodb_buffer_pool ɗinka ya gaza 1GB, ya kamata ka yi amfani da girman pool da aka raba da 128MB. Ci gaba da amfani da wannan lissafin har zuwa matsakaicin adadin ƙwayoyin CPU ko 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s zai raba innodb_buffer_pool zuwa yankunan ƙwaƙwalwa don inganta aiki ga sigogin MySQL har zuwa da kuma haɗa da MySQL 8.0. Matsakaicin ƙima shine 64, amma bai kamata ya wuce adadin ƙwayoyin CPU/zarukan aiki ba. Lokacin da innodb_buffer_pool ɗinka ya gaza 1GB, ya kamata ka yi amfani da girman pool da aka raba da 128MB. Ci gaba da amfani da wannan lissafin har zuwa matsakaicin adadin ƙwayoyin CPU ko 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Idan kana da rumbunan SSD, yi amfani da wannan shawarar. Idan kana da rumbunan hard drive na zahiri, yi amfani da 200 * adadin rumbunan da ke aiki a cikin array. Idan ana amfani da NVMe ko PCIe Flash, za a iya amfani da lambobi masu girma har zuwa 100000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Idan kana da rumbunan SSD, yi amfani da wannan shawarar. Idan kana da rumbunan hard drive na zahiri, yi amfani da 2000 * adadin rumbunan da ke aiki a cikin array. Idan ana amfani da NVMe ko PCIe Flash, za a iya amfani da lambobi masu girma har zuwa 200000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Idan kana da rumbunan SSD, yi amfani da wannan shawarar. In ba haka ba, kada a saita wannan saitin."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Tare da ajiyar nau'in SSD na zamani, samun zaren aiki na karanta io da yawa yana da fa'ida ga manhajoji masu yawan halayen io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Tare da ajiyar nau'in SSD na zamani, samun zaren aiki na rubuta io da yawa yana da fa'ida ga manhajoji masu yawan halayen io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da MariaDB 10.2.4 da sama, wannan saitin ya kamata ya kasance a kashe idan an kunna rubutun atomic.  Saboda haka, da fatan za a kunna rubutun atomic maimakon buffer na rubutu sau biyu domin zai ƙara saurin aiki."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da MariaDB 10.2.4 da sama, za ka iya amfani da rubutun atomic a kan buffer na rubutu sau biyu don ƙara saurin aiki."

