msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Yanayin da cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin tantancewa a sabar LDAP.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - Babu binciken Distinguished Name (DN) da zai faru, kawai yunƙurin haɗawa da tsarin Distinguished Name (DN) da aka bayar.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Yana ƙoƙarin bincika sunan mai amfani a kundin LDAP ta hanyar haɗin da ba a bayyana suna ba don gano Distinguished Name (DN) na masu amfani.<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Yana ƙoƙarin bincika sunan mai amfani a kundin LDAP ta hanyar Specific Distinguished Name (DN) da Specific Password don haɗawa da gano Distinguished Name (DN) na masu amfani."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Tushen bincike don bincikar kundin adireshin LDAP, kamar <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> ko <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: user_domains.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Matatar bincike da za a yi amfani da ita don gano mai amfani a cikin kundin adireshin LDAP, kamar ga Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> ko ga OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  Ana maye gurbin \"&lt;username&gt\" da sunan mai amfani da aka shigar a wurin shiga."

