#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>LURA:</strong> Ka shiga cikin Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa. Lokacin da yake <b>'kan layi'</b>, za ka iya dubawa da sarrafa yawancin Babban Shafin Yanar Gizo na Kadupul kamar dai ka shiga cikinsa. Haka kuma, yana da muhimmanci a lura cewa Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa suna buƙatar amfani da fasalin Sabis ɗin Haɓaka Aiki na Kadupul na <b>'Sabuntawa Bisa Buƙata'</b>, kuma koyaushe muna ba da shawarar amfani da Spine. Lokacin da Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa yake <b>'a kashe'</b>, Shafin Yanar Gizo na Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa zai ƙunshi bayanai kaɗan. Duk da haka, zai adana duk sabuntawa har sai Babban Rumbun Bayanai na Kadupul da Sabar Yanar Gizo sun kasance a samuwa. Sannan zai zubar da fitarwar teburin Boost ɗinsa zuwa Babban Rumbun Bayanai na Kadupul don sabuntawa."

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>LURA:</strong> Babu ɗaya daga cikin Muhimman Plugins na Kadupul, har zuwa yau, da aka sake tsarawa don yin aiki tare da Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa. Saboda haka, Plugins kamar MacTrack, da HMIB, waɗanda ke buƙatar samun damar kai tsaye zuwa na'urori ba za su yi aiki tare da Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa ba a wannan lokacin. Duk da haka, plugins kamar Thold za su yi aiki muddin Mai Tattara Bayanai na Nesa yana cikin yanayin <b>'kan layi'</b>."

